[{"id":"e11-faithfulness-not-correctness","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Agent 质量工程","tags":["Agent 质量工程","测试开发"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-quality/Agent 质量工程(十一)RAG评测.md","articleTitle":"Agent 质量工程(十一)RAG评测","articlePath":"posts/511464f8/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-quality/Agent 质量工程(十一)RAG评测.md","articleTitle":"Agent 质量工程(十一)RAG评测","articlePath":"posts/511464f8/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>“引用覆盖”的课程边界中，为什么“忠实度”不是“正确性”？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>忠实度只提供召回/精确；正确性还需要在faithfulness上由定位完整确认，不能只看文本或单个事件。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>在rag夹具中分别运行“忠实度”和“正确性”，比较命中相关片段与回答是否由证据支持；指标阈值应按有答案、无答案、过期和冲突分层。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"g09-healer-skip-not-fix","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"AI 辅助测试","tags":["AI 辅助测试","测试开发"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/ai-assisted-testing/AI 辅助测试(九)缺陷分析与维护.md","articleTitle":"AI 辅助测试(九)缺陷分析与维护","articlePath":"posts/6c305e52/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/ai-assisted-testing/AI 辅助测试(九)缺陷分析与维护.md","articleTitle":"AI 辅助测试(九)缺陷分析与维护","articlePath":"posts/6c305e52/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/ai-assisted-testing/AI 辅助测试(十二)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"AI 辅助测试(十二)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/18a17ffa/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>“回归判断”的课程边界中，为什么“修复器跳过”不是“修复”？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>修复器跳过只提供人工审查；修复还需要在rerun上由状态清楚确认，不能只看文本或单个事件。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>在patch夹具中分别运行“修复器跳过”和“修复”，比较diff 与理由与干净环境、固定数据；一次绿灯不能证明 flaky 已修好；要保存重跑次数、环境和失败样本。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"f02-answer-not-safe-execution","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Agent 安全","tags":["Agent 安全","测试开发"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-security/Agent 安全(二)威胁建模.md","articleTitle":"Agent 安全(二)威胁建模","articlePath":"posts/c3459386/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-security/Agent 安全(二)威胁建模.md","articleTitle":"Agent 安全(二)威胁建模","articlePath":"posts/c3459386/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>“安全目标”的课程边界中，为什么“回答”不是“安全执行”？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>回答是模型生成的文本，安全执行还要求身份、权限、参数和写入结果全部通过门禁。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>威胁建模从资产、信任边界和攻击者开始，再排序风险；危险词列表不能说明哪一条路径会产生损失。把这条区别落到夹具：分别构造正常、越界和撤销样本，保存为用户、模型、工具、数据和外部内容画边界，给每条跨界路径标资产和风险。回答文本安全不等于执行安全；真正的风险要落到调用、数据和副作用。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-L2-003","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["交换机","FDB"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网","articlePath":"posts/474f4d81/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网","articlePath":"posts/474f4d81/"}],"articleIndex":9,"articleCount":18,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>交换机如何学习 FDB？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>它从收到帧的源 MAC 和入端口建立或更新映射。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>目的 MAC 用于查找转发方向，源 MAC 用于学习位置。FDB 会老化、变化或在设备重启后丢失，所以它是动态状态。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>观察交换机时，先区分“学习”与“转发”两个动作：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>输入\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>交换机动作\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>观察结果\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>源 MAC 从端口 1 进入\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>记录 MAC → 端口 1\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>FDB 新增或刷新\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>目的 MAC 已在端口 2\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>查询 FDB\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>只发往端口 2\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>目的 MAC 未知\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>暂时无法定向\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>同广播域泛洪且不回入端口\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>因此主机换端口或条目老化时，短暂泛洪是动态学习的结果；要判断故障，还要看端口、VLAN 和后续是否重新学习。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-DIAG-004","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["DNS","TCP","TLS","HTTP"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障","articlePath":"posts/61ba71fc/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(九)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(九)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e25e16df/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(八)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(八)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/e470b049/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障","articlePath":"posts/61ba71fc/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":10,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>如何区分 DNS 失败、TCP 拒绝、TLS 证书失败和 HTTP 502？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>DNS 失败没有目标 IP，TCP 拒绝没有建立连接，TLS 失败通常 TCP 已建立但证书/握手未通过，502 则说明某个 HTTP 网关已经返回响应。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>错误字符串可能随客户端变化，必须结合 DNS 查询、SYN/RST、TLS 握手和响应头判断，不要把所有现象称为“网络不通”。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>可把错误放到一条时间线上：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight text\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">DNS → TCP → TLS → HTTP 网关 → 上游服务\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">无 IP   RST/超时  证书/握手  502/504   应用结果\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>每个错误字符串都要回到对应报文、响应头或服务端日志；不要把缺少 HTTP 响应的失败写成 4xx/5xx。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-DIAG-FAQ-003","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["tcpdump","抓包","证据"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障","articlePath":"posts/61ba71fc/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(七)抓包与网络排障","articlePath":"posts/61ba71fc/"}],"articleIndex":8,"articleCount":10,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>tcpdump 没有抓到包，说明客户端没有发送吗？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>不能。接口、命名空间、权限、捕获点、过滤器、硬件卸载和流量走向都可能导致观察不到。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>先用 \u003ccode>tcpdump -D\u003c/code>、宽过滤器和接口状态确认观察位置，再得出发送与否的结论。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>先确认“采集阶段”还是“显示阶段”：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>工具\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>过滤发生时机\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>示例\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>tcpdump\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>捕获时\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>host 198.51.100.20 and tcp port 443\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>Wireshark\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>已捕获数据上\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>ip.addr == 198.51.100.20 &amp;&amp; tcp.port == 443\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>若没有包，先检查接口、命名空间、权限、捕获点和宽过滤器，再收窄条件。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"fastapi-0141-def-vs-async-def","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["并发","路由"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(十)并发模型与后台任务.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(十)并发模型与后台任务","articlePath":"posts/801e2897/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(十)并发模型与后台任务.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(十)并发模型与后台任务","articlePath":"posts/801e2897/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>FastAPI 中 \u003ccode>def\u003c/code> 和 \u003ccode>async def\u003c/code> 路由如何选择？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>已有同步 I/O 可用 \u003ccode>def\u003c/code> 让框架放入线程池；异步库和可等待 I/O 使用 \u003ccode>async def\u003c/code>，并确保阻塞工作被隔离。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>关键不是函数关键字，而是调用链是否会让出执行资源。\u003ccode>def\u003c/code> 路由通常在线程池运行，线程数量有限；\u003ccode>async def\u003c/code> 在事件循环运行，遇到真正的 \u003ccode>await\u003c/code> 才释放控制权。同步数据库或 \u003ccode>time.sleep\u003c/code> 放进异步函数仍会冻结事件循环，需改用异步库或显式线程/进程。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a8-ping-curl","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Linux","tags":["网络分层","HTTP"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(八)网络连接与远程排障.md","articleTitle":"Linux(八)网络连接与远程排障","articlePath":"posts/3a757ef9/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(八)网络连接与远程排障.md","articleTitle":"Linux(八)网络连接与远程排障","articlePath":"posts/3a757ef9/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":5,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>ping 成功能否证明 HTTPS 正常？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>不能。ping 验证 ICMP 可达，HTTPS 还需要 DNS、TCP、TLS、代理和应用层响应。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>把一次 HTTPS 请求拆成可观察的层：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">ip route get 203.0.113.10       \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 路由与出口接口\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">dig +short example.com          \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># DNS 结果\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">ss -tn \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;( dport = :443 )&#x27;\u003c/span>       \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># TCP 连接状态\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">curl --verbose --fail-with-body https://example.com/  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># TLS 与 HTTP\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>\u003ccode>ping\u003c/code> 只证明 ICMP 回显路径可用；DNS、TCP 端口、TLS 证书/代理以及应用响应仍可能失败。每层的成功只能缩小范围，不能直接升级成“HTTPS 端到端健康”。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"mysql84-11-stock-for-update-p1","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"mysql-8.4-interview","tags":["FOR UPDATE","库存","防超卖"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十一)锁与并发控制.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十一)锁与并发控制","articlePath":"posts/2d2f0ce4/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十一)锁与并发控制.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十一)锁与并发控制","articlePath":"posts/2d2f0ce4/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(十五)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(十五)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e11b5c6b/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>两个并发请求都要扣减同一商品库存，如何避免超卖？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cfigure class=\"highlight sql\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">START\u003c/span> TRANSACTION;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> quantity \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> inventory \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WHERE\u003c/span> product_id \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">101\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FOR\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">UPDATE\u003c/span>;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">UPDATE\u003c/span> inventory \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SET\u003c/span> quantity \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> quantity \u003cspan class=\"operator\">-\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">2\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WHERE\u003c/span> product_id \u003cspan class=\"operator\">=\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">101\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AND\u003c/span> quantity \u003cspan class=\"operator\">&gt;=\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">2\u003c/span>;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> ROW_COUNT();\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"comment\">-- 1 后 COMMIT；0 后 ROLLBACK\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>两个请求的关键差异在于“读取和扣减是否共享同一个锁定事务”：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight text\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">T1: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE → 读到 10 → 扣 2 → COMMIT\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">T2: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE → 等 T1 提交 → 读到 8 → 扣 2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>条件 \u003ccode>UPDATE ... WHERE quantity &gt;= 2\u003c/code> 是第二道保险，\u003ccode>ROW_COUNT() = 0\u003c/code> 时回滚或重试。若先普通 \u003ccode>SELECT\u003c/code> 再独立 \u003ccode>UPDATE\u003c/code>，两个请求可能都读到 10，最终一起扣减形成超卖；事务应尽量短，死锁或锁等待失败时重试完整事务。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-function-args-params","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","函数","参数","调用"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(五)流程控制与函数.md","articleTitle":"Python(五)流程控制与函数","articlePath":"posts/a62147da/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(五)流程控制与函数.md","articleTitle":"Python(五)流程控制与函数","articlePath":"posts/a62147da/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>实参和形参有什么区别？\u003ccode>/\u003c/code> 与 \u003ccode>*\u003c/code> 在函数签名中做什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>实参是调用时给出的对象，形参是函数内的名称；\u003ccode>/\u003c/code> 前仅限位置，\u003ccode>*\u003c/code> 后仅限关键字。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>调用先按签名绑定实参，\u003ccode>/\u003c/code> 和 \u003ccode>*\u003c/code> 再限制调用者使用哪种写法：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">announce\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">title, /, *labels, urgent=\u003cspan class=\"literal\">False\u003c/span>, **meta\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">return\u003c/span> title, labels, urgent, meta\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">announce(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;release&quot;\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;python&quot;\u003c/span>, urgent=\u003cspan class=\"literal\">True\u003c/span>)  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 合法\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">announce(title=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;release&quot;\u003c/span>)                  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># TypeError：title 在 / 左侧\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>位置专用参数适合不希望暴露参数名的低层接口；关键字专用参数能让 \u003ccode>urgent=True\u003c/code> 这类语义更清楚。形参是函数内部的名称，实参是调用表达式提供的对象，两者不要混成同一个概念。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-scenario-shipping-discount","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["场景","运费","判定表"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(八)规则组合与判定测试.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(八)规则组合与判定测试","articlePath":"posts/ed62e469/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(八)规则组合与判定测试.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(八)规则组合与判定测试","articlePath":"posts/ed62e469/"}],"articleIndex":8,"articleCount":15,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>会员、订单金额和地区共同决定运费时如何设计测试？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>按满减、优惠后金额和地区条件生成判定列，覆盖临界金额、免邮结果和条件冲突。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>固定规则：普通地区满 100 减 10；运费门槛按优惠后金额判断，优惠后金额低于 99 收 5，达到 99 免基础运费；偏远地区固定附加费 8，币种最小单位固定。模型：满减条件 × 优惠后门槛边界 × 地区附加费，先算商品优惠，再算运费。\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>用例\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>前置与数据\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>步骤与观察\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>预期\u003c/th>\n\u003cth style=\"text-align:right\">优先级\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>选择理由\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>SD-01\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>商品原价 100.00，普通地区\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>加入商品→提交结算→观察折扣、优惠后金额、运费\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>满减后 90.00；低于 99，收运费 5；总额 95\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\">1\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>满减有效但未过包邮门槛\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>SD-02\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>商品原价 108.99，普通地区\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>结算→观察金额链路\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>满减后 98.99；收 5 运费\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\">1\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>包邮门槛左邻点\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>SD-03\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>商品原价 109.00，普通地区\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>结算→观察金额链路\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>满减后 99.00；免基础运费\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\">1\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>包邮门槛最小有效值\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>SD-04\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>商品原价 110.00，普通地区\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>结算→观察折扣和运费\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>满减后 100.00；免基础运费；总额 100\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\">1\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>门槛内邻值\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>SD-05\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>商品原价 99.00，普通地区\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>结算→观察是否触发满减和运费\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>不满 100 不减；优惠后 99.00，基础运费为 0；总额 99.00\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\">1\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>满减门槛与包邮边界\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>SD-06\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>商品原价 109.00，偏远地区\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>结算→观察基础运费、附加费和总额\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>满减后 99.00，基础运费 0，偏远附加费 8；总额 107.00\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd style=\"text-align:right\">1\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>地区条件独立\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>选择理由：100、108.99、109、110 隔离满减和优惠后包邮的两组边界；99 与偏远地区用来确认条件是否独立。遗漏与追问：运费是否计入满减门槛、会员折扣先后、券与满减叠加、退款时运费回退、地区规则缺失时的默认行为。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-a14-concept-1","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["缺陷报告","复现"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(十四)缺陷管理与测试报告.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(十四)缺陷管理与测试报告","articlePath":"posts/adb68b7b/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(十四)缺陷管理与测试报告.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(十四)缺陷管理与测试报告","articlePath":"posts/adb68b7b/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>开发说无法复现时，测试者怎么办？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>补齐版本、环境、数据、步骤和证据，尝试最小复现并区分偶现、环境阻塞和真实产品差异。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>先保存原始失败的时间、构建、账号状态、输入、日志和请求 ID，再在同一条件重跑；若只在并发或特定时区出现，记录触发条件和可控种子。无法再次出现不等于缺陷不存在，也不等于一定是产品问题；应把复现概率、已排除条件和下一步观察写进报告。敏感附件先脱敏。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]